   \n        <div id=\"pnlContent\" class=\"pvwrap\">\n\t<!-- =========================================================\n  EVENT DETAIL PAGE — SECTION INDEX\n  [1] PRELUDE & LOGIC (title + ticket availability)\n  [2] HERO (event background image)\n  [3] EVENT DETAIL (title, description, meta, CTAs)\n  [4] MEDIA CAROUSEL (full-width swiper)\n  [5] EVENT DETAIL (CTA repeat)\n  [6] THE SPACE (venue info; conditional)\n  [7] PIER MOMENTS (rotator block)\n  [8] EXPLORE (footer rotator)\n========================================================= -->\n\n<main>\n  <!-- ========== [1] PRELUDE & LOGIC ========== -->\n  <script>\n    // Set the document title from the event name\n    var x = \"Parent and Baby Secret Film Screenings: Festive Edition\";\n    document.title = x;\n  </script>\n\n  <!-- Hidden ticket counters (repeated per ticket type) -->\n  <div class=\"fpr-hide fpr-ticket-counter\">229</div>\n  <div class=\"fpr-hide fpr-ticket-sorting\">£5.00</div>\n\n  <!-- Toggle Book Now vs Waitlist based on availability -->\n  <script>\n    $(document).ready(function () {\n      let totalTickets = 0;\n      let zeroCount = 0;\n\n      $(\".fpr-ticket-counter\").each(function () {\n        totalTickets++;\n        const value = parseInt($(this).text().trim(), 10);\n        if (value === 0) zeroCount++;\n      });\n\n      if (totalTickets > 0 && zeroCount === totalTickets) {\n        $(\".fpr-action-book-now\").hide();\n        $(\".fpr-action-waitlist\").show();\n      } else {\n        $(\".fpr-action-waitlist\").hide();\n      }\n    });\n  </script>\n\n  <!-- ========== [2] HERO ========== -->\n  <div class=\"fpr-section-hero fpr-section-hero-reduced\">\n    <div class=\"fpr-hero-content fpr-padding-global\">\n      <div class=\"fpr-container\">\n        <div class=\"fpr-padding-vertical fpr-padding-large\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"fpr-bgimg-wrap\">\n      <img class=\"fpr-bgimg-img\" src=\"https://peoplevineuk.blob.core.windows.net/media/41/411130c75b-cc19-4d37-a01d-0f04b8190148.jpg\" alt=\"An image for the Parent and Baby Secret Film Screenings: Festive Edition event\">\n      <div class=\"fpr-bgimg-overlay\"></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  \n  <div class=\"fpr-hide similar-page\">4321</div>\n\n  <!-- ========== [3] EVENT DETAIL (title, description, meta, CTAs) ========== -->\n  <div class=\"fpr-section-eventdetail\">\n    <div class=\"fpr-padding-global\">\n      <div class=\"fpr-container\">\n        <div class=\"fpr-padding-vertical fpr-padding-xlarge\">\n          <div class=\"fpr-margin-bottom fpr-margin-normal fpr-max-width-40\">\n            <h1 class=\"fpr-text-h2\">Parent and Baby Secret Film Screenings: Festive Edition</h1>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"fpr-grid-2col fpr-grid-6040\">\n            <!-- Left: Description + CTAs -->\n            <div>\n              <!-- If you prefer the short summary, switch to At Parent and Baby Secret Film Screenings expect a feel good movie experience created just for mums and their little sidekicks. -->\n              <div class=\"fpr-text-p1 fpr-text-rich\"><p dir=\"ltr\">At our Parent &amp; Baby Secret Film Screenings, expect a feel-good festive movie experience designed especially for parents and their little ones. It's your chance to press pause on the pre-Christmas chaos, gather your friends, and enjoy some well-deserved \"you time\".</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Here's the twist: the film is a surprise. We choose the movie, and you simply arrive ready to enjoy a classic festive favourite. Think classic, heart-warming films that help you relax, unwind, and switch off for a while.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">The screening environment is created with parents and babies in mind, with soft lighting, relaxed sound levels, and a supportive, judgement-free atmosphere where feeding, cuddling, and the occasional wiggle are completely welcome.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Babies must be under 12 months old and held in arms. Up to four adults may attend with one baby; adults arriving without a baby will not be admitted. Buggy space and baby-changing facilities are available.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Tickets are £5.00 and include&nbsp;entry to Orange Box and popcorn.</p>\n<div class=\"x_elementToProof\" data-olk-copy-source=\"MessageBody\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"x_elementToProof\" data-olk-copy-source=\"MessageBody\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"x_elementToProof\" data-olk-copy-source=\"MessageBody\">Why not join us for some food and drink before, during, or after? You’ll find casual bites and drinks in <a href=\"https://eur03.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.fulhampier.com%2Friverside-market%3Fsrsltid%3DARcRdnqLnCKbt7HeJH_SUoaPv_3W6PKDzXBc7f3RUl4IUxjINyWaAQYb&amp;data=05%7C02%7Cmboettcher%40fulhampier.com%7C78b12f8d89e441ede32e08df2098f353%7Cd2528add01004f27b2de8bc457332d3d%7C0%7C0%7C639265513414824986%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=fMG%2B4AIc8q5sZtoVbbAFkSwk43oHydMK09cxKNSdvAE%3D&amp;reserved=0\" data-auth=\"NotApplicable\" originalsrc=\"https://www.fulhampier.com/riverside-market?srsltid=ARcRdnqLnCKbt7HeJH_SUoaPv_3W6PKDzXBc7f3RUl4IUxjINyWaAQYb\" id=\"OWA5ca0c1c6-e17d-4425-1b1c-f1265c884bbd\" class=\"x_OWAAutoLink\" title=\"Original URL: https://www.fulhampier.com/riverside-market?srsltid=ARcRdnqLnCKbt7HeJH_SUoaPv_3W6PKDzXBc7f3RUl4IUxjINyWaAQYb. Click or tap if you trust this link.\" data-linkindex=\"0\">Riverside Market,</a> from burgers, to Middle-Eastern,&nbsp;tacos to cocktails. And if you’re looking for something more refined, why not book a table at <a href=\"https://eur03.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fconstancerestaurant.com%2F&amp;data=05%7C02%7Cmboettcher%40fulhampier.com%7C78b12f8d89e441ede32e08df2098f353%7Cd2528add01004f27b2de8bc457332d3d%7C0%7C0%7C639265513414869701%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%